153
00:10:41,570 --> 00:10:42,830
ELEVENTH ANGEL

154
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,790
FACTS CONCERNING THE ATTACK
ARE CURRENTLY UNCONFIRMED

155
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:48,040
WILD RUMOR OF A DIRECT INVASION
OF NERV HEADQUARTERS

156
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,710
This is no good.

157
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:50,540
HUMAN INSTRUMENTALITY COMMITTEE
SPECIAL MEETING CONVENED

158
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:49,420
It's happening too early.

159
00:10:49,420 --> 00:10:50,540
Indeed!

160
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:54,800
An Angel invading Nerv HQ
was outside of our schedule.

161
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:58,340
And worse, to think that you let it
intrude into Central Dogma.

162
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:00,300
If contact had occurred then,

163
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:03,390
our entire project could have ended in disaster.

164
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:06,140
The report to this committee was in error.

165
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:08,730
No Angel invasion took place.

166
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:14,270
Ikari, are you then saying the Eleventh Angel's
intrusion did not occur?

167
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,030
Yes.

168
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:18,320
Speak with caution, Ikari.

169
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:21,490
Making false statements to this conference
is punishable by death.

170
00:11:21,490 --> 00:11:24,990
You are free to examine the Magi's recorders.

171
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:27,240
There is no evidence of any such incident.

172
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:31,960
This is absurd. Hiding the truth is your specialty.

173
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:36,170
The time schedule is advancing as described
in the Dead Sea Scrolls.

174
00:11:36,170 --> 00:11:37,840
Fine then.

175
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:41,090
We'll leave aside the matter of crimes
or responsibility on your part.

176
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:46,470
But there is no need for you
to create a new script.

177
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:49,180
I realize that.

178
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:52,900
Everything is proceeding
according to Seele's script.

179
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:56,320
CHAPTER FOURTEEN
SEELE, THRONE OF SOULS

180
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:03,910
Mountain...

181
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,490
Heavy mountains.

182
00:12:05,490 --> 00:12:07,740
Things that change over time.

183
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,210
Sky...

184
00:12:11,210 --> 00:12:12,790
Blue sky.

185
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:15,040
What your eyes can't see.

186
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:17,420
What your eyes can see.

187
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:20,010
Sun...

188
00:12:20,010 --> 00:12:21,760
A unique object.

189
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:23,430
Water...

190
00:12:23,430 --> 00:12:25,390
Something comforting.

191
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:27,180
Commander Ikari?

192
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,350
Flowers...

193
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:30,390
So many of the same.

194
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:32,770
And so many unneeded.

195
00:12:32,770 --> 00:12:34,230
Sky...

196
00:12:34,230 --> 00:12:36,900
Red, red sky.

197
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:38,360
The color red.

198
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,400
I hate the color red.

199
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:41,690
Water flowing.

200
00:12:41,690 --> 00:12:43,280
Blood...

201
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:44,530
The smell of blood.

202
00:12:44,530 --> 00:12:46,740
A woman who never bleeds.

203
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:49,700
Man made from red soil.

204
00:12:49,700 --> 00:12:52,540
Man made from man and woman.

205
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:56,460
City... A human creation.

206
00:12:56,460 --> 00:12:59,750
Eva... A human creation.

207
00:12:59,750 --> 00:13:03,670
What is a human? A creation of God?

208
00:13:03,670 --> 00:13:06,180
Is man a human creation?

209
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:09,260
The things I possess are life and soul.

210
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:10,930
I am a vessel for a soul.

211
00:13:10,930 --> 00:13:14,440
Entry plug, the throne for a soul.

212
00:13:14,690 --> 00:13:17,770
Who is this? This is me.

213
00:13:17,770 --> 00:13:25,110
Who am I? What am I? What am I?
What am I? What am I?

214
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:26,740
I am myself.

215
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:28,910
This object is me.

216
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:31,540
The form that shapes me.

217
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:35,910
This is the me that can be seen,
yet I feel as though I am not myself.

218
00:13:35,910 --> 00:13:37,620
Very strange.

219
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:39,960
I feel as if my body is melting.

220
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:44,470
I can no longer see myself.
My shape is fading.

221
00:13:44,470 --> 00:13:47,050
I feel the presence of someone who is not me.

222
00:13:47,050 --> 00:13:50,260
Is someone there, beyond this?

223
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,010
Ikari?

224
00:13:52,010 --> 00:13:54,730
I know this person. Major Katsuragi.

225
00:13:54,930 --> 00:13:56,480
Doctor Akagi.

226
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,690
Everyone.

227
00:13:57,690 --> 00:13:58,730
Classmates.

228
00:13:58,730 --> 00:14:00,520
The pilot of Unit 02.

229
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,650
Commander Ikari?

230
00:14:02,650 --> 00:14:03,860
Who are you?

231
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:05,360
Who are you?

232
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,860
Who are you?

233
00:14:08,410 --> 00:14:11,780
So, Rei, how does it feel to be piloting
Unit 01 for the first time?

234
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:15,120
It smells like Ikari.

235
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:19,120
FIRST UNIT INTERCHANGEABILITY TEST
SUBJECT REI AYANAMI

236
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:23,460
Her synch rate is almost the same
as with Unit 00.

237
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:27,510
Unit 00 and 01's personal data patterns
are very similar too, after all.

238
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,930
That's exactly what makes this
synchronization possible.

239
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:34,930
Error is plus or minus 0.03.
Harmonics are normal.

240
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:39,400
No interchangeability problems detected
between Rei and Unit 01.

241
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:41,060
Okay, the test is finished.

242
00:14:41,060 --> 00:14:43,900
Rei, you can get out now.

243
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:45,570
Yes, Ma'am.

244
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:54,790
87TH UNIT LINK-UP TEST
SUBJECT ASUKA LANGLEY SOHRYU

245
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:57,500
Data bank for Unit 02 complete.

246
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,620
Harmonics are all normal.

247
00:14:59,620 --> 00:15:01,540
Pilot status normal.

248
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:02,790
Of course!

249
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:06,630
FIRST UNIT INTERCHANGEABILITY TEST
SUBJECT SHINJI IKARI

250
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:08,380
Entry plug insertion complete.

251
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:10,680
What about Unit 00's personal data?

252
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:14,100
Already reconfigured. Currently reconfirming.

253
00:15:14,970 --> 00:15:16,220
Subject status?

254
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:19,770
He appears a bit nervous, but no problems
in his nerve patterns.

255
00:15:20,230 --> 00:15:22,310
This is his first time in Unit 00.

256
00:15:22,310 --> 00:15:24,730
It's another Eva, so it's only natural.

257
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:29,610
He's so stupid. He should just take it easy
and not worry about those things.

258
00:15:29,990 --> 00:15:33,030
Shinji's just not that kind of person.

259
00:15:33,030 --> 00:15:35,280
I know, that's why he's stupid.

260
00:15:36,990 --> 00:15:42,000
Speaking of which, don't I need to be involved
in their interchangeability test?

261
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:45,790
You don't want to pilot an Eva
besides Unit 02 anyway, do you?

262
00:15:46,090 --> 00:15:48,670
Well, you've got that right.

263
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,970
Eva Unit 02 definitely
wouldn't be interchangeable.

264
00:15:53,590 --> 00:15:55,800
Entry has commenced.

265
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,350
LCL electrolyzed.

266
00:15:57,350 --> 00:15:59,730
Initiating first connection.

267
00:15:59,730 --> 00:16:03,020
Shinji, how do you feel in Unit 00's entry plug?

268
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:05,270
It feels kind of odd.

269
00:16:05,270 --> 00:16:06,730
A sense of incongruity?

270
00:16:06,730 --> 00:16:08,570
No, it's just that...

271
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:10,530
It smells like Ayanami.

272
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:13,360
What does he mean, smell? Is he a pervert?

273
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,070
Data received. Reconfirming. Pattern green.

274
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:17,830
Main power supply connection complete.

275
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:19,580
All restraints are normal.

276
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:20,910
Roger.

277
00:16:20,910 --> 00:16:23,790
Now let's shift to the second stage
of the interchangeability tests.

278
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:26,540
Unit 00 will enter into second contact.

279
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:27,710
How is it?

280
00:16:27,710 --> 00:16:30,670
As I thought, the synch rate is lower
than that of Unit 01.

281
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:33,760
Harmonics are all normal.

282
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,340
But these are still good readings.

283
00:16:35,890 --> 00:16:39,260
This means we can implement that plan.

284
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:40,930
The dummy system, you mean?

285
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:43,850
I know you support it, but I'm not so...

286
00:16:43,850 --> 00:16:45,810
I understand why you wouldn't approve,

287
00:16:45,810 --> 00:16:50,610
but we always need to be prepared
so that mankind can survive.

288
00:16:50,610 --> 00:16:53,950
I highly respect you, Ma'am,
and I will do my duty,

289
00:16:53,950 --> 00:16:55,910
but I am not convinced about this project.

290
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:58,280
It's tough having a fastidious nature,

291
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:00,370
as far as living among people goes.

292
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:04,290
You'll understand that when
you feel that you've been sullied.

293
00:17:10,170 --> 00:17:12,550
Initiating third connection.

294
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:15,380
Self psycho-graph is stable.

295
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:19,560
Hey, Shin, how do you like mommy's breast?
Or is it more like inside her womb?

296
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:22,430
Asuka, it'll introduce data noise. Don't interfere.

297
00:17:22,430 --> 00:17:23,640
Okay, okay.

298
00:17:24,230 --> 00:17:27,600
What's with them? They're all so quick
to mollycoddle Shinji.

299
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:30,230
Initiate A-10 nerve connection.

300
00:17:30,230 --> 00:17:32,360
Harmonics level, plus twenty.

301
00:17:33,490 --> 00:17:35,110
What is this?

302
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:39,580
Something's trying to get directly into my brain.

303
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:42,370
Ayanami?

304
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,870
Rei Ayanami?

305
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:47,460
This impression is Rei Ayanami, isn't it?

306
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:51,460
Ayanami?

307
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:52,710
Isn't it her?

308
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:57,970
What's going on?

309
00:17:57,970 --> 00:17:59,850
We've got a problem occurring
in the pilot's nerve pulse.

310
00:17:59,850 --> 00:18:00,720
Pulse reversing!

311
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,390
Mental contamination is taking place.

312
00:18:02,390 --> 00:18:05,180
Impossible! That can't happen
at this plug depth.

313
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,390
It's not from the plug.

314
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:07,940
The intrusion's coming from the Eva.

315
00:18:16,450 --> 00:18:18,450
Unit 00 is out of control!

316
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:23,450
Shut off all circuits! Cut the power supply!

317
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:32,000
Eva has switched to backup power.

318
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,880
Still operational.

319
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:34,760
How's Shinji?

320
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:37,050
The circuit's disconnected.
We can't monitor him!

321
00:18:37,050 --> 00:18:39,260
Unit 00 is rejecting Shinji?

322
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:42,300
It's no good! The auto eject's not working!

323
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:44,680
The same thing as before...

324
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,310
Is it going to try to absorb Shinji?

325
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:55,280
Rei, get back! Rei!

326
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:58,070
Activation will be terminated in ten...

327
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:58,950
9...

328
00:18:58,950 --> 00:18:59,740
8...

329
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:00,570
7...

330
00:19:00,570 --> 00:19:01,410
6...

331
00:19:01,410 --> 00:19:02,200
5...

332
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:02,990
4...

333
00:19:02,990 --> 00:19:03,740
3...

334
00:19:03,740 --> 00:19:04,490
2...

335
00:19:04,490 --> 00:19:05,290
1...

336
00:19:05,290 --> 00:19:06,410
Zero!

337
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:10,710
Unit 00 has ceased activation.

338
00:19:10,710 --> 00:19:12,830
Hurry up and rescue the pilot!

339
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:17,880
Could it be that Unit 00 just tried to kill Rei?

340
00:19:21,130 --> 00:19:24,510
Was this somehow related to
the earlier berserk incident

341
00:19:24,510 --> 00:19:26,430
when Rei was the pilot?

342
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:29,060
I can't tell you anything right now.

343
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:32,810
I only know we must reconfigure Unit 00
for Rei's personal data,

344
00:19:32,810 --> 00:19:35,070
and run a new synch test between them
as soon as possible.

345
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:38,740
As Chief of Operations, I ask that you do so
as soon as possible,

346
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:40,860
before it impacts our work.

347
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:43,200
I know, Major Katsuragi.

348
00:19:51,580 --> 00:19:56,550
The person Unit 00 wanted to hit was me.
I'm sure of it.

349
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:59,800
<i><i>And now the next contestant</i></i>

350
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:03,300
<i><i>for the World's Most Amazing Exhibition is,
Math Puppy!</i></i>

351
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,470
<i><i>Wow, that sounds awesome!</i></i>

352
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:08,390
<i><i>Here we go, math genius puppy,
Kana, from Niigata!</i></i>

353
00:20:08,390 --> 00:20:09,060
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

354
00:20:09,060 --> 00:20:11,770
<i><i>He sounds good. Do you understand me?</i></i>

355
00:20:11,770 --> 00:20:12,350
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

356
00:20:12,350 --> 00:20:16,770
<i><i>Oh, right. Now let's ask him.</i></i>

357
00:20:16,770 --> 00:20:17,650
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

358
00:20:17,650 --> 00:20:21,490
<i><i>What is 325 minus 324?</i></i>

359
00:20:21,490 --> 00:20:22,400
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

360
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,780
<i><i>That's amazing! He's correct!</i></i>

361
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:27,120
I hate it. It's this ceiling again.

362
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:32,330
Shinji has regained consciousness.
No signs of mental contamination.

363
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:35,670
He doesn't appear to remember anything.

364
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:37,210
I see.

365
00:20:37,210 --> 00:20:39,670
<i><i>Hi! I'm doing fine,</i></i>

366
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:43,180
<i><i>but the world is worrisome due to
terrorism in the Nansa Islands.</i></i>

367
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:45,010
Misato and Mr. Kaji won't tell me,

368
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:47,640
<i><i>This year long heat creates some crazy
bastards, you know?</i></i>

369
00:20:45,010 --> 00:20:48,640
And Shinji doesn't even know.

370
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:50,350
<i><i>What I can't stand is those suicidal idiots
that involve innocent people!</i></i>

371
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,350
Just what kind of girl is the First Child?

372
00:20:51,810 --> 00:20:53,270
The Angel invasion that deviated from the plan.

373
00:20:53,020 --> 00:20:53,850
Knight

374
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,270
The Angel invasion that deviated from the plan.

375
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:58,650
So the Human Instrumentality Committee is
taking advantage of having learned of it.

376
00:20:58,650 --> 00:21:03,780
Though they're just worthless fools whose job
is to do nothing but complain.

377
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:09,330
We hold all the trump cards.
There is nothing they can do.

378
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:11,910
Still, that doesn't mean we should provoke them.

379
00:21:12,410 --> 00:21:16,790
If Seele starts interfering now, it'll be trouble,
in more ways than one.

380
00:21:16,790 --> 00:21:19,750
Everything is going according to our script.

381
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:21,760
There is no problem.

382
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:26,180
What about the Unit 00 accident?
That wasn't in my script.

383
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:27,720
It is no obstacle.

384
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:32,180
The re-synchronization test for Rei
and Unit 00 was successful.

385
00:21:32,180 --> 00:21:35,140
Ikari is too concerned about Rei.

386
00:21:35,140 --> 00:21:37,440
What is the status of the Adam Project?

387
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:40,110
Proceeding smoothly. It's not even
two percent behind schedule.

388
00:21:40,110 --> 00:21:42,570
Then, the Lance of Longinus is...

389
00:21:42,570 --> 00:21:43,740
It's going as planned.

390
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:45,400
Rei is carrying out the operation.

391
00:21:57,420 --> 00:22:00,630
TO BE CONTINUED

392
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:06,990
PREVIEW

393
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:09,860
With her friends getting married
one after another,

394
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:11,990
Misato alone begins to get worked up.

395
00:23:11,990 --> 00:23:16,580
Could the reunion between her and Kaji
be her last chance?

396
00:23:16,950 --> 00:23:19,410
Next episode: "Lies and Silence"

397
00:23:18,710 --> 00:23:21,040
LIES AND SILENCE
